  "id": 729,
  "description": "English speaking guild, European Time.\nWe&#039;re Monastery, fresh and new guild slowly appearing on the scene! \n\nWhy join us instead of different guilds?\n- Required at least 1 guild raid per 3 days, usually pushing 3 raids per day.\n\n2:00PM level 70\n\n5:30PM level 70\n\n9:00PM level 70\n\nAll UTC +2 (polish time)\n\n- Finishing challenges. More finished challenges mean more raids, mean more combat/guild exp!\n- No discord required.\n- Guild growth is as important as self growth. During big events you&#039;re not expected to join guild raids, it&#039;s better to push levels in these rare occassions!\n- Required combat level: 20\n\nIf you&#039;re a person who playes once per few days, you&#039;ll be removed from the guild pretty fast. It doesn&#039;t matter if you&#039;re newbie, old player, casual. The most important requirement is being active. \n\nHail Monastery.",
